   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>
            <b>Prerequisites</b>
         </p>
         <ul>
            <li>The X-Author Outlook add-in must have been installed and you are connected.</li>
            <li>You must be a member of at least one Chatter group</li>
         </ul>
         <p>
            <b>Steps</b>
         </p>
      </context>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Select the<b> X-Author Chatter</b> tab.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Select an existing group from the <b>Groups</b> list </cmd>
            <info>
               <p>- or -</p>
            </info>
            <info>
               <p>Click<b>Search Group</b> and select the desired group from the Groups search window.
</p>
            <fig>
                     <title>98671287</title>
                     <image href="../attachments/98671234/98671287.jpg" placement="break" width="1181" height="636">
                        <alt>placeholder</alt>
                     </image>
                  </fig></info>
            <info>
               <p>
</p>
            </info>
         </step>
      </steps>
      <result>
         <p>
            <b>Results</b>
         </p>
         <p>If you have the Chatter feed displayed you will see the feed update to display the group you selected.</p>
      </result>
   </taskbody>
</task>